The World Wrestling Council is the most well known wrestling promotion on the island of Puerto Rico. It is the home of wrestling legend Carlos Colon and for years has been a stopping point for wrestlers from around the world to come and earn a good payday. The promotion took a serious prestige hit following the murder of Bruiser Brody in the late 1980s, an event that forever damaged the wrestling industry on the island.
